---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-antes-volar" set:html={`
<section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div><div class="crumb">Viajes / Antes de volar</div><div class="eyebrow">Planificador de salida</div><h1>Llegá al aeropuerto con lo importante resuelto.</h1><p class="lede">Calculá cuándo salir, armá tu margen real y controlá documentos, check-in y equipaje antes de cerrar la puerta.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">Hora de salida exacta</span><span class="chip">Checklist personalizado</span><span class="chip">Todos los escenarios visibles</span></div></div><div class="boarding" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orb"></div><div class="ticket"><div class="ticket-top"><span>TARJETA DE EMBARQUE</span><span>PUERTA 18</span></div><div class="route"><b>Casa</b><i></i><b>AEP</b></div><div class="ticket-time">Tu cronograma, desde la puerta de casa hasta el embarque.</div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">Tu tipo de viaje</div><h2>Cada vuelo necesita un margen distinto</h2><p>Elegí un caso para cargar una base y después ajustá todos los datos a tu viaje.</p></div>
<div class="cases">
<button class="case active" data-case="0" type="button"><b>Vuelo nacional</b><small>Sin controles migratorios y con equipaje de mano.</small></button>
<button class="case" data-case="1" type="button"><b>Vuelo internacional</b><small>Más anticipación para migraciones y requisitos de ingreso.</small></button>
<button class="case" data-case="2" type="button"><b>Con valija despachada</b><small>Sumá tiempo para el mostrador y el cierre de despacho.</small></button>
<button class="case" data-case="3" type="button"><b>Con menores</b><small>Documentación adicional y un margen más cómodo.</small></button>
</div>
<div class="calc">
<div class="panel"><h3>Armá tu cronograma</h3><p class="intro">La anticipación es una recomendación de planificación. Confirmá siempre los límites de tu aerolínea.</p><div class="fields">
<div class="field full"><label for="departure">Fecha y hora del vuelo</label><input id="departure" type="datetime-local" value="2026-08-15T18:30"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="flightType">Tipo de vuelo</label><select id="flightType"><option value="domestic">Nacional</option><option value="international">Internacional</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="checkedBag">¿Despachás valija?</label><select id="checkedBag"><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Sí</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="minors">¿Viajás con menores?</label><select id="minors"><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Sí</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="transfer">Traslado al aeropuerto</label><input id="transfer" type="number" min="0" value="55"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="traffic">Margen por tránsito</label><input id="traffic" type="number" min="0" value="30"></div>
<div class="subhead">Checklist previo</div>
<div class="field"><label for="documents">Documento vigente</label><select id="documents"><option value="ready">Listo</option><option value="pending">Pendiente</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="checkin">Check-in online</label><select id="checkin"><option value="ready">Listo</option><option value="pending" selected>Pendiente</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="bags">Equipaje revisado</label><select id="bags"><option value="ready">Listo</option><option value="pending" selected>Pendiente</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="entry">Requisitos del destino</label><select id="entry"><option value="na">No aplica</option><option value="ready">Listos</option><option value="pending">Pendientes</option></select></div>
<div class="field full"><label for="permission">Permiso/documentos de menores</label><select id="permission"><option value="na">No aplica</option><option value="ready">Listos</option><option value="pending">Pendientes</option></select></div>
</div><div class="buttons"><button class="primary" id="calculate" type="button">Actualizar plan</button><button class="secondary" id="reset" type="button">Reiniciar</button></div></div>
<div class="panel result" aria-live="polite"><div class="res-top"><div><div class="label">Hora recomendada para salir</div><div class="amount" id="leaveTime">—</div><div class="date" id="leaveDate">—</div></div><span class="pill" id="scenario">Vuelo nacional</span></div><p class="summary" id="summary"></p><div class="timeline"><div class="metric"><span>Llegar al aeropuerto</span><strong id="airportTime">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Anticipación total</span><strong id="leadTime">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Traslado + tránsito</span><strong id="roadTime">—</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Estado del checklist</span><strong id="checkStatus">—</strong></div></div><div class="progress"><i id="bar"></i></div><div class="checkline"><span>Preparación previa</span><b id="checkText">—</b></div><div class="note" id="note">Confirmá horarios de check-in y despacho en tu reserva: cambian según aerolínea y aeropuerto.</div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section support"><div class="shell"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">Cuenta regresiva útil</div><h2>Qué resolver y cuándo</h2></div><div class="support-grid"><article class="support-card"><span>72–48 HORAS ANTES</span><h3>Documentos y requisitos</h3><p>Revisá vigencia, requisitos del destino, asistencia al viajero y autorizaciones si viajan menores.</p></article><article class="support-card"><span>24 HORAS ANTES</span><h3>Check-in y equipaje</h3><p>Confirmá el asiento, medí la valija y verificá peso, líquidos y objetos restringidos.</p></article><article class="support-card"><span>ANTES DE SALIR</span><h3>Estado del vuelo y traslado</h3><p>Revisá la terminal, la puerta disponible, el tránsito y cualquier aviso de la aerolínea.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell faq"><div class="head"><div class="eyebrow">Preguntas frecuentes</div><h2>Antes de cerrar la valija</h2></div><div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q" type="button">¿Con cuánta anticipación tengo que llegar?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">El plan usa 2 horas para vuelos nacionales y 3 para internacionales, más un margen si despachás valija o viajás con menores. Es una referencia: la condición válida es la de tu aerolínea.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">¿El tiempo de tránsito se suma al traslado?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Sí. Separarlos evita que un viaje habitual de 40 minutos se transforme en una llegada tarde por tránsito o demoras imprevistas.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button">¿Qué pasa si el vuelo sale pasada la medianoche?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">La calculadora considera la fecha completa y muestra correctamente si tenés que salir el día anterior.</div></div></div></section>
`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-antes-volar')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-antes-volar');

(()=>{
const $=id=>root.querySelector("#"+id);
const cases=[
{name:"Vuelo nacional",type:"domestic",bag:"no",minors:"no",entry:"na",permission:"na"},
{name:"Vuelo internacional",type:"international",bag:"no",minors:"no",entry:"pending",permission:"na"},
{name:"Con valija despachada",type:"domestic",bag:"yes",minors:"no",entry:"na",permission:"na"},
{name:"Con menores",type:"international",bag:"yes",minors:"yes",entry:"pending",permission:"pending"}
];
let active=0;
const pad=n=>String(n).padStart(2,"0");
const time=d=>`${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}`;
const date=d=>new Intl.DateTimeFormat("es-AR",{weekday:"long",day:"numeric",month:"long"}).format(d);
const duration=m=>m<60?`${m} min`:`${Math.floor(m/60)} h${m%60?` ${m%60} min`:""}`;
function compute(){
 const departure=new Date($("departure").value);
 if(Number.isNaN(departure.getTime())){ $("leaveTime").textContent="Elegí una fecha"; return; }
 const base=$("flightType").value==="international"?180:120;
 const extraBag=$("checkedBag").value==="yes"?20:0;
 const extraMinors=$("minors").value==="yes"?20:0;
 const lead=base+extraBag+extraMinors;
 const transfer=Math.max(0,Number($("transfer").value)||0);
 const traffic=Math.max(0,Number($("traffic").value)||0);
 const airport=new Date(departure.getTime()-lead*60000);
 const leave=new Date(airport.getTime()-(transfer+traffic)*60000);
 const statuses=["documents","checkin","bags","entry","permission"].map(id=>$(id).value).filter(v=>v!=="na");
 const ready=statuses.filter(v=>v==="ready").length;
 const total=statuses.length;
 const pct=total?Math.round(ready/total*100):100;
 $("leaveTime").textContent=time(leave);
 $("leaveDate").textContent=date(leave);
 $("airportTime").textContent=`${time(airport)} · ${date(airport)}`;
 $("leadTime").textContent=duration(lead);
 $("roadTime").textContent=duration(transfer+traffic);
 $("checkStatus").textContent=`${ready} de ${total} listos`;
 $("checkText").textContent=`${pct}% completo`;
 $("bar").style.width=`${pct}%`;
 $("scenario").textContent=cases[active].name;
 $("summary").textContent=`Tu vuelo sale a las ${time(departure)}. Para llegar al aeropuerto a las ${time(airport)}, salí a las ${time(leave)} y reservá ${duration(transfer+traffic)} para el camino.`;
 $("note").textContent=ready===total?"Lo esencial está marcado como listo. Antes de salir, revisá el estado del vuelo y la terminal.":`Todavía tenés ${total-ready} ${total-ready===1?"tarea pendiente":"tareas pendientes"}. Confirmá también los horarios de tu aerolínea.`;
}
function preset(i){
 active=i; const c=cases[i];
 $("flightType").value=c.type;$("checkedBag").value=c.bag;$("minors").value=c.minors;$("entry").value=c.entry;$("permission").value=c.permission;
 root.querySelectorAll("[data-case]").forEach((el,index)=>el.classList.toggle("active",index===i));
 compute();
}
root.querySelectorAll("[data-case]").forEach(el=>el.addEventListener("click",()=>preset(Number(el.dataset.case))));
root.querySelectorAll("input,select").forEach(el=>el.addEventListener("input",compute));
$("calculate").addEventListener("click",compute);
$("reset").addEventListener("click",()=>{$("departure").value="2026-08-15T18:30";$("transfer").value=55;$("traffic").value=30;$("documents").value="ready";$("checkin").value="pending";$("bags").value="pending";preset(0)});
root.querySelectorAll(".faq-q").forEach(q=>q.addEventListener("click",()=>q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));
preset(0);
})();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-antes-volar{--ink:#172331;--muted:#5e6f80;--blue:#174b7a;--sky:#e9f4fa;--mint:#35b596;--mint2:#e6f8f2;--coral:#e77c67;--sun:#f3bd55;--line:#d9e3e8;--paper:#fbfcfa;--white:#fff;--shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(23,75,122,.1)}.mockup-antes-volar *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-antes-volar{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.mockup-antes-volar button,.mockup-antes-volar input,.mockup-antes-volar select{font:inherit}.mockup-antes-volar .shell{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px}.mockup-antes-volar .header{height:76px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center}.mockup-antes-volar .nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.mockup-antes-volar .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:900}.mockup-antes-volar .logo{width:31px;height:35px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px}.mockup-antes-volar .links{display:flex;gap:24px;color:#526074;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.mockup-antes-volar .navbtn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;color:#46566a}.mockup-antes-volar .hero{padding:52px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ebf8f4,#fff7e7 58%,#eaf4fa)}.mockup-antes-volar .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.mockup-antes-volar .crumb{color:var(--blue);font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-antes-volar .eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:var(--blue);margin-top:18px}.mockup-antes-volar .hero h1{font-size:52px;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:12px 0 17px;max-width:690px}.mockup-antes-volar .lede{font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:#536174}.mockup-antes-volar .chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.mockup-antes-volar .chip{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d4e2df;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:11px;color:#38645a;font-weight:800}.mockup-antes-volar .boarding{height:310px;position:relative}.mockup-antes-volar .orb{position:absolute;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;right:24px;top:20px;background:#d9edf1}.mockup-antes-volar .ticket{position:absolute;left:25px;top:55px;width:300px;border-radius:22px;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--blue);box-shadow:14px 16px 0 rgba(53,181,150,.22);padding:24px}.mockup-antes-volar .ticket-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--blue);font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em}.mockup-antes-volar .route{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:22px 0}.mockup-antes-volar .route b{font-size:29px}.mockup-antes-volar .route i{height:2px;background:var(--mint);flex:1;position:relative}.mockup-antes-volar .route i:after{content:"›";position:absolute;right:-1px;top:-15px;font-size:22px;color:var(--mint)}.mockup-antes-volar .ticket-time{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-antes-volar .section{padding:62px 0}.mockup-antes-volar .head{text-align:center;max-width:790px;margin:0 auto 29px}.mockup-antes-volar .head h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.mockup-antes-volar .head p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.mockup-antes-volar .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:11px;margin-bottom:22px}.mockup-antes-volar .case{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:17px;padding:16px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);min-height:108px}.mockup-antes-volar .case.active{border:2px solid var(--blue);background:var(--sky)}.mockup-antes-volar .case b{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px}.mockup-antes-volar .case small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.4}.mockup-antes-volar .calc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.05fr;gap:22px;align-items:start}.mockup-antes-volar .panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:23px;padding:27px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.mockup-antes-volar .panel h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 7px}.mockup-antes-volar .intro{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 20px}.mockup-antes-volar .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px}.mockup-antes-volar .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-antes-volar .field label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-antes-volar .field input,.mockup-antes-volar .field select{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #cbd5df;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);padding:0 12px;outline:none}.mockup-antes-volar .field input:focus,.mockup-antes-volar .field select:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(23,75,122,.12)}.mockup-antes-volar .subhead{grid-column:1/-1;margin:8px 0 -2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:900}.mockup-antes-volar .buttons{display:flex;gap:9px;margin-top:20px}.mockup-antes-volar .primary,.mockup-antes-volar .secondary{border-radius:12px;padding:13px 16px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.mockup-antes-volar .primary{border:1px solid var(--blue);background:var(--blue);color:#fff;flex:1}.mockup-antes-volar .secondary{border:1px solid #ccd6df;background:#fff;color:#47576b}.mockup-antes-volar .result{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#174b7a,#287b9b);color:#fff}.mockup-antes-volar .result .intro{color:#d8eaf2}.mockup-antes-volar .res-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.mockup-antes-volar .label{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#cbe7ef;font-weight:900}.mockup-antes-volar .amount{font-size:46px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:8px 0 0}.mockup-antes-volar .date{font-size:12px;color:#dbeef3;margin-bottom:14px}.mockup-antes-volar .pill{height:max-content;background:#e5faf3;color:#155e4e;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:10px;font-weight:900}.mockup-antes-volar .summary{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#f3fafb}.mockup-antes-volar .timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-top:17px}.mockup-antes-volar .metric{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);background:rgba(255,255,255,.11);border-radius:14px;padding:14px}.mockup-antes-volar .metric span{display:block;color:#d6eaf0;font-size:10px}.mockup-antes-volar .metric strong{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:18px;margin-top:4px}.mockup-antes-volar .progress{height:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:18px}.mockup-antes-volar .progress i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--sun);border-radius:99px;transition:.25s}.mockup-antes-volar .checkline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#e6f3f6}.mockup-antes-volar .note{margin-top:14px;background:#fff2d7;color:#684817;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.mockup-antes-volar .support{background:#f0f7f5}.mockup-antes-volar .support-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:13px}.mockup-antes-volar .support-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px}.mockup-antes-volar .support-card span{display:inline-block;background:var(--mint2);color:#176d5b;border-radius:8px;padding:5px 7px;font-size:9px;font-weight:900}.mockup-antes-volar .support-card h3{font-size:15px;margin:11px 0 6px}.mockup-antes-volar .support-card p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.mockup-antes-volar .faq{max-width:850px;margin:auto}.mockup-antes-volar .faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-antes-volar .faq-q{width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;text-align:left;padding:19px 3px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-antes-volar .faq-a{display:none;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;padding:0 35px 18px 3px}.mockup-antes-volar .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.mockup-antes-volar .footer{height:100px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}@media(max-width:900px){.mockup-antes-volar .links{display:none}.mockup-antes-volar .hero-grid,.mockup-antes-volar .calc{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-antes-volar .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-antes-volar .support-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-antes-volar .hero h1{font-size:43px}}@media(max-width:560px){.mockup-antes-volar .shell{padding:0 16px}.mockup-antes-volar .hero h1{font-size:35px}.mockup-antes-volar .boarding{display:none}.mockup-antes-volar .cases,.mockup-antes-volar .fields,.mockup-antes-volar .timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-antes-volar .panel{padding:21px}.mockup-antes-volar .res-top{display:block}.mockup-antes-volar .pill{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px}}

.mockup-antes-volar { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-antes-volar .top, .mockup-antes-volar header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-antes-volar .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-antes-volar .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-antes-volar .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-antes-volar .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-antes-volar .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-antes-volar .support-real p { color:#52657b; line-height:1.65; }
/* Prevent the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text
   designed to inherit a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-antes-volar :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td) { color:inherit; }
.mockup-antes-volar input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance:textfield; appearance:textfield; }
.mockup-antes-volar input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, .mockup-antes-volar input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-antes-volar .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-antes-volar support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
